104
00:03:31.419 --> 00:03:34.299
It takes the logit, not the probability:

105
00:03:34.299 --> 00:03:36.459
the sigmoid happens inside the loss.

106
00:03:36.921 --> 00:03:37.359
Why fused?

107
00:03:37.622 --> 00:03:39.550
Training numbers are float thirty-two:

108
00:03:39.550 --> 00:03:40.382
