109
00:03:40.645 --> 00:03:42.135
Take a logit of twenty and no hit.

110
00:03:42.398 --> 00:03:43.449
The true cost is twenty.

111
00:03:43.712 --> 00:03:45.552
But compute the sigmoid first and p comes

112
00:03:45.552 --> 00:03:47.305
out as exactly one, so one minus p is

113
00:03:47.305 --> 00:03:49.014
zero, and minus log zero is infinity.

114
00:03:49.276 --> 00:03:51.248
PyTorch clamps that to a hundred, which is

115
00:03:51.248 --> 00:03:51.774
still wrong.

116
00:03:52.037 --> 00:03:53.789
The fused version works straight from z

117
00:03:53.789 --> 00:03:54.490
and gets twenty.

118
00:03:54.753 --> 00:03:56.068
Same maths, safe arithmetic.

119
00:03:59.413 --> 00:04:00.633
That's one drum in one slot.

120
00:04:00.895 --> 00:04:02.594
A batch has nine drums, thousands of

